    handle: "custom-boof/02"
    type: "custom-boof"
    valence: "boon"
    excerpt: "Ant-warmth smelled earthy and even, like bread left under a cloth. This was sharper. A candle just blown out. Boof knew the paths to the kitchens, the mill, and the grove nobody liked to name after dark. She had never..."
    route: ^[chapter/01/s02]{open}
