  s03: {
    handle: "section/03"
    type: "section"
    title: "When a Berry Remembers"
    excerpt: "Every boonberry had been a blueberry once. A wish had passed over it on the way to being granted, leaving a little of its light behind. Most slept through everything: snow, crows, harvest. The town used them for suppe..."
