    type: "section"
    title: "The Maps That Look Away"
    excerpt: "By morning, Boof had brought the egg to the map-house in an old feed-sack. It was warm as a loaf and considerably heavier. She set it on the reading table. The archivist fetched a book. Along a fold in the map, two ro..."
    route: ^[chapter/01/s05]{open}
