  s06: {
    handle: "section/06"
    type: "section"
    title: "Following the Hum"
    excerpt: "Outside, the berries still leaned toward the grove. Boof had spent the morning asking a book. The field had been pointing all along. She settled the feed-sack against her chest, where a pup might ride. A fine gold cra..."
